 Analysis Set: All enrolled participants that were randomized to either the danicopan or placebo treatment group. Here, 'Overall number of participants analyzed' = participants evaluable for this outcome measure.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"LEAST_SQUARES_MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Error","unitOfMeasure":"g/L","timeFrame":"Baseline, Week 12","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan (TP1)","description":"Participants received danicopan TID for 12 weeks, in addition to their background ravulizumab or eculizumab therapy, during TP1."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Placebo (TP1)","description":"Participants received placebo TID for 12 weeks, in addition to their background ravulizumab or eculizumab therapy, during TP1."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"57"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"28"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Interim Efficacy Analysis","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"42"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"21"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"29.40","spread":"2.107"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"4.96","spread":"3.128"}]}]},{"title":"Full Analysis","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"57"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"28"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"28.08","spread":"1.957"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"4.62","spread":"3.018"}]}]}],"analyses":[{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"Interim Efficacy Analysis","nonInferiorityType":"SUPERIORITY","pValue":"0.0007","statisticalMethod":"Re-randomization Test"},{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"Full Analysis","nonInferiorityType":"SUPERIORITY","pValue":"0.0007","statisticalMethod":"Re-randomization Test"},{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"Interim Efficacy Analysis","nonInferiorityType":"SUPERIORITY","pValue":"<0.0001","statisticalMethod":"Mixed Models Analysis","paramType":"LS Mean Difference","paramValue":"24.44","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"16.90","ciUpperLimit":"31.99","dispersionType":"STANDARD_ERROR_OF_MEAN","dispersionValue":"3.751"},{"groupIds":["OG000","OG001"],"groupDescription":"Full Analysis","nonInferiorityType":"SUPERIORITY","pValue":"<0.0001","statisticalMethod":"Mixed Models Analysis","paramType":"Difference","paramValue":"23.46","ciPctValue":"95","ciNumSides":"TWO_SIDED","ciLowerLimit":"16.31","ciUpperLimit":"30.61","dispersionType":"STANDARD_ERROR_OF_MEAN","dispersionValue":"3.585"}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percentage of Participants With Hgb Increase of ≥2 Grams/Deciliter (g/dL) (≥20 g/L) From Baseline in the Absence of Transfusion at Week 12","description":"The criterion was defined as ≥20 g/L increase in Hgb from Baseline to Week 12 and remaining transfusion free during the 12-Week TP1. Participants who withdrew from the study early during the 12-Week TP1 or had missing Hgb value at Week 12 were considered as not achieving the criterion.","populationDescription":"Interim Efficacy Analysis Set: Per the prespecified plan for interim analysis, the first 75% of enrolled participants that were randomized to either the danicopan or placebo treatment group. Full Analysis Set: All enrolled participants that were randomized to either the danicopan or placebo treatment group.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"NUMBER","dispersionType":"95% Confidence Interval","unitOfMeasure":"percentage of participants","timeFrame":"Week 12","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan (TP1)","description":"Participants received danicopan TID for 12 weeks, in addition to their background ravulizumab or eculizumab therapy, during TP1."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Placebo (TP1)","description":"Participants received placebo TID for 12 weeks, in addition to their background ravulizumab or eculizumab therapy, during TP1."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"57"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"29"}]}],"cl