olled participants that were randomized to either the danicopan or placebo treatment group. Full Analysis Set: All enrolled participants that were randomized to either the danicopan or placebo treatment group. Here, 'Overall number of participants analyzed' and 'Number Analyzed' = participants evaluable for this outcome measure.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"LEAST_SQUARES_MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Error","unitOfMeasure":"units/L","timeFrame":"Baseline, Week 12","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Danicopan (TP1)","description":"Participants received danicopan TID for 12 weeks, in addition to their background ravulizumab or eculizumab therapy, during TP1."},{"id":"OG001","title":"Placebo (TP1)","description":"Participants received placebo TID for 12 weeks, in addition to their background ravulizumab or eculizumab therapy, during TP1."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"56"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"28"}]}],"classes":[{"title":"Interim Efficacy Analysis","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"42"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"20"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"-23.49","spread":"8.287"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"-2.92","spread":"11.914"}]}]},{"title":"Full Analysis","denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"56"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"28"}]}],"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"-25.60","spread":"7.932"},{"groupId":"OG001","value":"-16.92","spread":"11.380"}]}]}]},{"type":"SECONDARY","title":"Percentage of Participants With Hgb Normalization at Week 12","description":"Hgb normalization was defined as Hgb value above lower limit of normal (LLN) reference range. For male, the LLN was 125 g/L, for female, the LLN was 110 g/L. Participants with transfusions within 4 weeks prior to Week 12 were considered as not meeting Hgb normalization regardless of actual value observed at Week 12.","population